000000000000<install_instructions><![CDATA[
000000000000     *----------------------------------------------------------------      ------
000000000000     *  1. Upload entire XML to your AS/400 to a source file 112 long, into any mbr
000000000000     *     name not in this XML (suggest member name like ABCX or XYZX). The source
000000000000     *     file must be in the library where source and objects are to be installed.
000000000000     *
000000000000     *  2. If you have XMLPREVIEW installed, skip to step 3.
000000000000     *
000000000000     *     Copy the text between the start tag <install_program> and the end
000000000000     *     tag </install_program> into any member name (your choice)
000000000000     *     in file QRPGLESRC member type RPGLE.   CRTBNDRPG to compile.
000000000000     *     NOTE: You need extract the install program only once, this same program
000000000000     *           will install any upload on this page.
000000000000     *
000000000000     *  3. Call the install program (or execute XmlPrevew) passing these 3 parms.
000000000000     *       'your-member-name you uploaded this text into'
000000000000     *       'your-source-file-name the member is in'
000000000000     *       'your-library-name the source file is in'
000000000000     *
000000000000     *  The various source members will be extracted and the objects required
000000000000     *   for the application will be created in your-library-name.
000000000000     *----------------------------------------------------------------      ------
000000000000]]>  </install_instructions>
