000000000000.*****************************************************************
000000000000.*  Primary help text for the command.
000000000000.*****************************************************************
000000000000:HELP NAME='CHGOBJDA'.
000000000000Change Object Description Attr - Help
000000000000:P.
000000000000The Change Object Description Attr (CHGOBJDA) command changes
000000000000various attributes of an object description.
000000000000:P.
000000000000Although the command originally was designed to help us to
000000000000customize a change management product CHGOBJDA can also be used
000000000000stand alone.
000000000000:EHELP.
000000000000
000000000000.*****************************************************************
000000000000.*  Help text for the command parameters.
000000000000.*****************************************************************
000000000000
000000000000.********************************************
000000000000.*  Keyword:  OBJ
000000000000.********************************************
000000000000:HELP NAME='CHGOBJDA/OBJ'.
000000000000Object (OBJ) - Help
000000000000
000000000000:XH3.Object (OBJ)
000000000000
000000000000:P.
000000000000Specifies the qualified name of the object whose attributes
000000000000are being changed.  If no library name is given, *LIBL
000000000000is used to find the specified object. The library name
000000000000is entered to ensure that the correct object is being
000000000000specified.
000000000000
000000000000:IMHELP name='COM/REQPARM'.
000000000000:P.
000000000000The possible :HP2.Object name:EHP2. values are:
000000000000
000000000000:PARML.
000000000000:PT.:PV.Object name:EPV.
000000000000:PD.Specify the name of the object to be changed.
000000000000:EPARML.
000000000000:P.
000000000000
000000000000The possible library values are:
000000000000
000000000000:PARML.
000000000000:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
000000000000:PD.All libraries in the job's library list are searched
000000000000until the first match is found.
000000000000:PT.:PV.*CURLIB:EPV.
000000000000:PD.The current library for the job is used to locate the
000000000000object. If no library is specified as the current
000000000000library for the job, QGPL is used.
000000000000:PT.:PV.Library name:EPV.
000000000000:PD.Specify the name of the libary.
000000000000:EPARML.
000000000000:EHELP.
000000000000
000000000000.********************************************
000000000000.*  Keyword:  OBJTYPE
000000000000.********************************************
000000000000:HELP NAME='CHGOBJDA/OBJTYPE'.
000000000000Object type (OBJTYPE) - Help
000000000000
000000000000:XH3.Object type (OBJTYPE)
000000000000
000000000000:P.
000000000000Specifies the object type of the object that is being changed.  For a
000000000000complete list of object types, position the cursor on the field for the
000000000000:HP2.Object type:EHP2. prompt (OBJTYPE parameter), and press F4.
000000000000
000000000000:IMHELP name='COM/REQPARM'.
000000000000:P.
000000000000:IMHELP name='COM/VALUES'.
000000000000
000000000000:PARML.
000000000000:PT.:PV.object-type:EPV.
000000000000:PD.Specify the predefined value that identifies the
000000000000object type to be changed.
000000000000:EPARML.
000000000000:EHELP.
000000000000
000000000000.********************************************
000000000000.*  Keyword:  SRCF
000000000000.********************************************
000000000000:HELP NAME='CHGOBJDA/SRCF'.
000000000000Source file (SRCF) - Help
000000000000
000000000000:XH3.Source file (SRCF)
000000000000
000000000000:P.
000000000000Specifies the name of the source file that contains the
000000000000source member that was used to create the object.
000000000000
000000000000:IMHELP name='COM/OPTPARM'.
000000000000:P.
000000000000:IMHELP name='COM/VALUES'.
000000000000
000000000000:PARML.
000000000000:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
000000000000:PD.The source file name does not change.
000000000000:PT.:PV.*BLANK:EPV.
000000000000:PD.The source file name is not specified.
000000000000:PT.:PV.source-file-name:EPV.
000000000000:PD.Enter the name of the source file that contains the
000000000000source member that was used to create the object.
000000000000:EPARML.
000000000000:EHELP.
000000000000
000000000000.********************************************
000000000000.*  Keyword:  SRCFLIB
000000000000.********************************************
000000000000:HELP NAME='CHGOBJDA/SRCFLIB'.
000000000000Source file library (SRCFLIB) - Help
000000000000
000000000000:XH3.Source file library (SRCFLIB)
000000000000
000000000000:P.
000000000000Specifies the name of the library that contains the source file
000000000000that contains the source member that was used to create the object.
000000000000
000000000000:IMHELP name='COM/OPTPARM'.
000000000000:P.
000000000000:IMHELP name='COM/VALUES'.
000000000000
000000000000:PARML.
000000000000:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
000000000000:PD.The name of the library does not change.
000000000000:PT.:PV.*BLANK:EPV.
000000000000:PD.The name of the library is not specified.
000000000000:PT.:PV.library-name:EPV.
000000000000:PD.Specifies the name of the library that contains the source file
000000000000that contains the source member that was used to create the object.
000000000000:EPARML.
000000000000:EHELP.
000000000000
000000000000.********************************************
