000000000000
000000000000:XH3.Source member (SRCMBR)
000000000000
000000000000:P.
000000000000Specifies the name of the member of the source file that
000000000000contains the source that was used to create the object.
000000000000
000000000000:IMHELP name='COM/OPTPARM'.
000000000000:P.
000000000000:IMHELP name='COM/VALUES'.
000000000000
000000000000:PARML.
000000000000:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
000000000000:PD.The name of the member of the source file does not change.
000000000000:PT.:PV.*BLANK:EPV.
000000000000:PD.The name of the member of the source file is not specified.
000000000000:PT.:PV.source-file-member-name:EPV.
000000000000:PD.Specifies the name of the member of the source file that
000000000000contains the source that was used to create the object.
000000000000:EPARML.
000000000000:EHELP.
000000000000
