000000000000:HELP NAME='CHGOBJDA/SRCDATE'.
000000000000Source member change date (SRCDATE) - Help
000000000000
000000000000:XH3.Source member change date (SRCDATE)
000000000000
000000000000:P.
000000000000In a source physical file, the change date is the date
000000000000that the content of the file was last changed.
000000000000
000000000000:IMHELP name='COM/OPTPARM'.
000000000000:P.
000000000000:IMHELP name='COM/VALUES'.
000000000000
000000000000:PARML.
000000000000:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
000000000000:PD.The change date does not change.
000000000000:PT.:PV.*SRCMBR:EPV.
000000000000:PD.The change date is set to the change date retrieved from the
000000000000source member specified at the :HP2.Source member:EHP2. (SRCMBR) parameter.
000000000000:PT.:PV.Last-change-date:EPV.
000000000000:PD.Date that the content of the file was last changed.
000000000000:EPARML.
000000000000:EHELP.
000000000000
000000000000.********************************************
000000000000.*  Keyword:  SRCTIME
000000000000.********************************************
000000000000:HELP NAME='CHGOBJDA/SRCTIME'.
000000000000Source member change date (SRCTIME) - Help
000000000000
000000000000:XH3.Source member change time (SRCTIME)
000000000000
000000000000:P.
000000000000In a source physical file, the change time is the time
000000000000that the content of the file was last changed.
000000000000
000000000000:IMHELP name='COM/OPTPARM'.
000000000000:P.
000000000000:IMHELP name='COM/VALUES'.
000000000000
000000000000:PARML.
000000000000:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
000000000000:PD.The change time does not change.
000000000000:PT.:PV.*SRCMBR:EPV.
000000000000:PD.The change time is set to the change time retrieved from the
000000000000source member specified at the :HP2.Source member:EHP2. (SRCMBR) parameter.
000000000000:PT.:PV.Last-change-date:EPV.
000000000000:PD.Time that the content of the file was last changed.
000000000000:EPARML.
000000000000:EHELP.
000000000000
000000000000.********************************************
